---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const STREAM_SRC =
  'https://customer-wa9cpywo3l4jte5c.cloudflarestream.com/b57c8ba1ccfcac3f68aefcb6221de6b3/iframe?muted=true&loop=true&autoplay=true&poster=https%3A%2F%2Fcustomer-wa9cpywo3l4jte5c.cloudflarestream.com%2Fb57c8ba1ccfcac3f68aefcb6221de6b3%2Fthumbnails%2Fthumbnail.jpg%3Ftime%3D%26height%3D600&controls=false';
---

<Layout>
  <Header />

  <main class="flex-1">
    <section class="relative bg-navy-950">
      <div class="relative w-full" style="padding-top: 54.32098765432099%;">
        <iframe
          src={STREAM_SRC}
          title="Secure AI Frameworks hero video"
          loading="lazy"
          style="border: none; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; height: 100%; width: 100%;"
          allow="accelerometer; gyroscope; autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture;"
          allowfullscreen="true"
        ></iframe>
        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-navy-950 via-navy-950/55 to-navy-950/20"></div>
        <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-end">
          <div class="container-narrow w-full pb-6 pt-16 sm:pb-12 sm:pt-20">
            <p class="mb-3 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widestx text-signal-300 sm:text-xs">
              AI Security · Governance · Risk · Control
            </p>
            <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
              Secure AI Frameworks
            </h1>
            <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-navy-100/90 sm:mt-5 sm:text-lg">
              The exact-match domain for the category forming as AI is adopted worldwide — security expressed as frameworks.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-2 sm:mt-8 sm:flex-row sm:gap-3">
              <a href="#value" class="btn-primary pointer-events-auto">Why it is valuable</a>
              <a href="#acquisition" class="btn-secondary pointer-events-auto">$250,000</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="category" class="section-padding bg-navy-50">
      <div class="container-narrow max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widestx text-signal-500">The category</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-navy-950 sm:text-4xl">Secure AI is no longer a feature. It is a framework problem.</h2>
        <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-navy-800 sm:text-base">
          <p>
            Models are now in products, call centers, clinics, banks, and government workflows. Boards do not buy “AI magic.” They buy <strong class="text-navy-950">secure AI frameworks</strong> — repeatable controls for data, identity, evaluation, monitoring, and incident response.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong class="text-navy-950">SecureAIFrameworks.com</strong> is that phrase, unabbreviated. It is what a CISO searches, what a regulator writes into guidance, and what a vendor wants on a pitch deck.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="value" class="section-padding bg-white">
      <div class="container-narrow">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
          <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widestx text-signal-500">The value</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-navy-950 sm:text-4xl">Why this is the most valuable name in the set</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-12 grid gap-4 sm:gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-navy-950">Exact-match SEO</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-navy-700">
              The title is the query: Secure AI Frameworks. No invented brand to teach. Search, ads, and type-in all point at the same string.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-navy-950">Worldwide demand curve</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-navy-700">
              AI adoption is not a single-country story. Every enterprise market now needs named frameworks for model risk, privacy, and secure deployment.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-navy-950">Frameworks, not tools</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-navy-700">
              Tools churn. Frameworks persist. The domain sits above products — usable by a standard body, a consultancy, a platform, or a government program.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-navy-950">Category lock</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-navy-700">
              Once a firm owns this hostname, competitors must brand around it. That is the difference between a marketing URL and a category asset.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl bg-navy-950 p-6 text-center sm:p-10">
          <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widestx text-signal-400">Asking price</p>
          <p class="mt-3 font-display text-5xl font-semibold text-signal-300 sm:text-6xl">$250,000</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-navy-200">A one-time acquisition for the phrase the market is standardizing on.</p>
          <a href="#acquisition" class="btn-primary mt-6">Request terms</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="adoption" class="section-padding bg-navy-50">
      <div class="container-narrow grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start">
        <div>
          <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widestx text-signal-500">Worldwide adoption</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-navy-950 sm:text-4xl">Every deployment raises the same question</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-navy-800 sm:text-base">
            Who is allowed to call the model? What data may leave the boundary? How are outputs evaluated? What happens when a prompt injection lands?
            Those are framework questions. They appear in every sector that is putting AI into production.
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-sm text-navy-800 sm:text-base">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-signal-400"></span><span><strong class="text-navy-950">Enterprise</strong> — security reviews now include model supply chain, logging, and human override.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-signal-400"></span><span><strong class="text-navy-950">Regulated industry</strong> — healthcare, finance, and public sector need documented AI controls.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-2 h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-signal-400"></span><span><strong class="text-navy-950">Vendors</strong> — platforms sell trust as much as inference. The name is the claim.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-200 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8">
          <dl class="space-y-5">
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-navy-100 pb-4">
              <dt class="text-sm text-navy-600">Phrase</dt>
              <dd class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-navy-950 sm:text-2xl">Secure AI Frameworks</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-navy-100 pb-4">
              <dt class="text-sm text-navy-600">Scope</dt>
              <dd class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-navy-950 sm:text-2xl">Global</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-navy-100 pb-4">
              <dt class="text-sm text-navy-600">Buyers</dt>
              <dd class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-navy-950 sm:text-2xl">CISO · Platform · Policy</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
              <dt class="text-sm text-navy-600">Offer</dt>
              <dd class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-signal-500 sm:text-2xl">$250,000</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-t border-navy-200 bg-white py-10 sm:py-12">
      <div class="container-narrow text-center">
        <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-xs leading-relaxed text-navy-600 sm:text-sm">
          Information presented is for demonstration and educational purposes only and does not constitute an offer of consulting or software services.
          The domain is offered at the stated asking price; terms are subject to a written agreement.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
